\par Detects horizontal edges in the image.
\par 
\par For kernel type see \uldb \b Convolution Kernels\plain\b\fs24 {\v Convolution_Kernel}\plain\fs24 
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Filter Type Laplacian}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Filter_Type_Laplacian}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Filter Type Laplacian
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par Detects edges in the image by performing a Laplace transform using the 4 neighbouring pixels. 
\par Laplace transforms are second order gradient functions.
\par 
\par For kernel type see \uldb \b Convolution Kernels\plain\b\fs24 {\v Convolution_Kernel}\plain\fs24 
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Filter Type Laplacian 2}
