\b\fs36\cf1 Filter Type Laplacian 2
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par Detects edges in the image by performing a Laplace transform using the 8 neighbouring pixels. 
\par Laplace transforms are second order gradient functions.
\par 
\par For kernel type see \uldb \b Convolution Kernels\plain\b\fs24 {\v Convolution_Kernel}\plain\fs24 
\par 
\par \page
