\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par Copies the image form Source to Destination
\par 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx6795\cellx11265\pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab Select \b Source\plain\fs24  from the \ul Drop-down List\plain\fs24 {\v XYVXW3@Sem.HLP} (Buffer A = displayed image, Buffer B = stored image)
